# Ignore common files and directories
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/README.md
**/Docker-Setup.md

# Ignore build outputs
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/publish

# Ignore IDE files
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.sln.docstates

# Ignore logs
**/logs
**/*.log

# Ignore temporary files
**/tmp
**/temp
**/.tmp
**/.temp

# Ignore OS generated files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Ignore secrets/env files (never bake these into an image layer)
**/appsettings.secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.secrets.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
